    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d516">

                <pb facs="0797" n="775" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg775"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/12–851: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States Representative at the United
                        Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Austin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                        
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-12-08T19:00:00+01:00">December 8, 1951—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Delga 573. Re joint resolution on
                    self-determination (Delga 564, Dec 8), staff
                    intends recommend USGADel take following
                    action in Committee Three Monday morning, Dec 10: <list>
                        <label>(1)</label>
                        <item>Speak in favor of general principle of self-determination as related
                            to nonself-governing territories, countries which have lost their
                            independence in recent years and countries whose independence may be
                            threatened.</item>
                        <pb facs="0798" n="776" xml:id="pg776"/>
                        <label>(2)</label>
                        <item>Introduce following amendment to operative paragraph: <list>
                                <item>“Decides to include a provision in the International Covenant
                                    on Human Rights recognizing the principle of self-determination
                                    of peoples enunciated in the Charter of the United
                                    Nations.”</item>
                            </list>
                        </item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
